-- 2. Source.Systems.Restaurant.Tasks: serving happens on Tasks.TaskInputReceived, which is
--    fired only by Tasks:HandleInput(part, position). HandleInput is reached from
--    OnInputBegan (a real UserInputService MouseButton1 raycast) or OnSpeechBubbleClicked.
--    HandleInput itself rejects a target when dx^2 + dz^2 > 1024 or |dy| > 32 relative to
--    your HumanoidRootPart. So a click on the customer, from within ~32 studs, is the only
--    route that runs ServeFood at all.
--
-- 3. require() cannot load these modules in this VM (matches api-memory: require cannot load
--    instances), and getgc() with no key returns 0 entries here, so the Tasks table cannot be
--    reached to fire TaskInputReceived directly. Dead end, do not retry.
